  "hints": [
    "List what can change independently: the spots, how a spot is chosen, and how a fee is computed. Which of those should ParkingLot not contain any if/else about?",
    "Turn each spot policy into a sort key over the free spots that fit, and each pricing policy into a function from (vehicle, minutes) to cents. Keep a name-to-policy map so a new policy is one more entry.",
    "park: filter free spots by the fit table, take the one with the smallest key, mark it taken, store the ticket. leave: look up and delete the ticket (that makes a second leave return -1), free the spot, and ask the current pricing for the fee."
  ],
  "complexity": {
    "time": "O(S) per park for S spots; O(1) per leave and spotOf",
    "space": "O(S + active tickets)"
  }
}